From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Mulkey <thomasmulkey1997@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:36:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp: Document SM4450
 USB3/DP PHY

The SM4450 has a USB3/DP combo PHY with the same clock and reset layout
as the other four-clock combo PHYs: aux, ref, com_aux and usb3_pipe
clocks, and phy and common resets.

The USB30_PRIM GDSC is attached to the USB controller, so the PHY node
takes no power domain.

Signed-off-by: Thomas Mulkey <thomasmulkey1997@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml   | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
index 8adfc78108fef3e427d84e264d4ff3246c4ad5f6..045fc0821cee8b58e1a8cd8051ded5f5f377b472 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sc8180x-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
           - qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy
           - qcom,sdm845-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
+          - qcom,sm4450-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
           - qcom,sm6350-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
           - qcom,sm8150-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
           - qcom,sm8250-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
